        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Really just about anything made after 2015<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated GPU supporting Shader Model 4.5<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> AMD GPUs will perform worse than Nvidia equivalents. Integrated GPUs will also struggle.</li></ul>",
